{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a work simulation game with a slightly scary atmosphere and loop elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a dormitory manager and your job is to inspect all the dormitories from the 1st to the 10th floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's at least one violation of dorm rules on every floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sound of your footsteps, the sound of the door opening, and the light of your flashlight may cause these dorm violations to hide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, you need to move slowly if necessary, or turn off the flashlight, and after observing the type of violation, give them the necessary persuasion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you think you've dealt with all the violations, go upstairs. Repeat until you reach the tenth floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Visual sense of high school dormitory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Randomly generated replay experience.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427590?t=1740394748","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427590?t=1740394748","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427590/2bab453a6c5bc67be994c46be44e6de6ca3f21ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740394748","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427590/2bab453a6c5bc67be994c46be44e6de6ca3f21ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740394748","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a work simulation game with a slightly scary atmosphere and loop elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a dormitory manager and your job is to inspect all the dormitories from the 1st to the 10th floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There's at least one violation of dorm rules on every floor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sound of your footsteps, the sound of the door opening, and the light of your flashlight may cause these dorm violations to hide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So, you need to move slowly if necessary, or turn off the flashlight, and after observing the type of violation, give them the necessary persuasion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you think you've dealt with all the violations, go upstairs. Repeat until you reach the tenth floor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Visual sense of high school dormitory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Randomly generated replay experience.</p>","developers":["h.n"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427590/header.jpg?t=1740394748","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257095800,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095800/movie480.mp4?t=1740274549","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095800/movie_max.mp4?t=1740274549"},"name":"\u5ba1\u6838\u7528","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257095800/601dcae2368f7cb0d056da6d791f8c483994578f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740274549","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257095800/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740274549","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trail